-- ve-pricing-points-passport: saved answers for the survey-only door (Sean, 2026-11-07).
update guide_kb_answers g set answer = v.a, updated_at = now() from (values
('03438267-db14-41ca-b158-560d4bad6745'::uuid,'Points unlock topic Guides (1,100 points each), pay for asking your Guide directly (4 points a message), and can be given to a business or nonprofit you love as a boost. You earn them by taking part, starting with 250 for the survey, and every purchase earns a 25-point thank-you. Points are never bought.'),
('07fd86e3-bbc9-42b6-928b-757ceeec3933'::uuid,'Passport is the name we used for membership. Today membership is free: take a short survey and you are in, with 250 points for it. Members vote in the Directory, post on the boards, claim their business page free and get their own dashboard. After that you buy only what you want: topic Guides, merchandise and event tickets.'),
('0bdce1b3-bbfa-4df4-bcdb-886f790b0478'::uuid,'Yes, by invitation. A Nonprofit Partner is a rescue, sanctuary or nonprofit in our Directory that shares Vegans Explore with its people. It gets its own link, points for our services, a ready-made kit to share and a Nonprofit Partner badge. Cash commissions are paused for now. Ask our team.'),
('0f8c110b-4929-4948-9503-38bc5e3cf141'::uuid,'Members can choose from our Guides. Everyone else is matched with Liz.'),
('112a11e9-3621-4aa9-8bf2-b3ff48ef0513'::uuid,'By invitation. A Group Partner is a community group in our Directory (a social club, meetup, potluck or dinner club) that hosts its community and events here. It gets its own link, tickets for its events on our pages and featured spots as it brings people in. Cash commissions are paused for now. Ask our team.'),
('112c3e3a-8f01-40cf-a39d-cb6d4f1d8d4a'::uuid,'Yes. Looking around is free for everyone, and membership is free too: take a short survey, about two minutes, and you are in, with 250 points for it. Members vote, post on the boards, claim their business page and more. If you want to give more later, you can contribute from $11.'),
('1e951fc9-2c03-410c-82c1-235575a7d6fd'::uuid,'Vegans Explore is a LESARUSS brand. Membership is free with a short survey. Any money you give is a membership contribution, never a tax-deductible donation.'),
('252a02c3-6207-483f-a380-3cee043967ea'::uuid,'Make your account and take the short Explorer survey, about two minutes. Finish it and you are a member right away, with 250 points. If you run a business, its Guide''s own survey (Restaurant, Events, Creator, Nonprofit) also makes you a member and opens that Guide.'),
('26757593-46ca-43d8-847a-1118c5c858b2'::uuid,'Every member is a Vegan Explorer. Members find open roles under Opportunities on their dashboard, and each city is led by a Community Manager (gig work, paid as the community grows).'),
('298dc9f1-5105-45d4-86f7-ec61c3c36fe5'::uuid,'Members vote in the Directory, post and reply on the Community Board, see members'' contact details, claim their business page free, and get their own dashboard with a Guide. The survey starts you with 250 points; more come from taking part, and lifetime points move you up through the levels.'),
('301cad56-a07e-4373-854f-eec06a1083b7'::uuid,'You get 111 points when a friend you refer becomes a member by finishing the survey. Cash commissions are paused for now. They can enter your referral code when they sign up.'),
('313dc6a9-491c-4a84-a5bb-e2f38bc46dc8'::uuid,'Every member is a Vegan Explorer: a member of the Vegans Explore community who explores their city, votes, checks in and helps the Directory grow. There is nothing to apply for.'),
('4354654a-845e-4dc7-a330-d7a5e6398bbf'::uuid,'A Founding Member is anyone who becomes a member before midnight Eastern on January 1, 2027, by finishing the survey. Founding Member stays on your profile for good. Founding Members help shape what we are building.'),
('501b00e6-2201-4161-bd4d-471ea70f63e1'::uuid,'Guides (small g) are step-by-step guides. Topic Guides like the Dairy Guide are $11 or 1,100 points; Guides for your work are free with their survey, and the Welcome Guide is free. Your Guide is the helper in your dashboard who answers questions.'),
('51afb34f-efe5-4757-9d1c-9f99e3a05b6e'::uuid,'There is. Membership is free: take a short survey, about two minutes, and you are in. You can also look around the Directory, the Pulse, the communities and the Board without an account.'),
('6464d6b4-7398-44ff-869d-8ecdf1dd9ced'::uuid,'Our topic Guides (Dairy, Nutrition, Airport, Stadium & Arena, Theme Park, Supermarket) are $11 or 1,100 points for members, and yours to keep. A business Guide (Restaurant, Events, Creator, Nonprofit) opens when you finish its survey, with up to 250 points. The Welcome Guide is free.'),
('6b787dc6-aca0-467f-89fd-e555f216a7a4'::uuid,'Once. Anyone who is not a member yet can come to one free event hosted by a Group Partner as our guest: take the guest pass on the event''s page with your name and email, and your code comes by email. From your second event, join free with a short survey. Events with paid tickets need a membership from the start.'),
('6ba89120-e2d7-4b1b-b827-2a5ff1329f7d'::uuid,'Community Managers, yes: it is gig work, paid as the community in their city grows. Vegan Explorers are every member, and they earn points, levels and perks.'),
('7de7faef-beb9-4279-af29-eec4c9c61ac2'::uuid,'Points cannot be bought. The survey gives you 250, each purchase gives a 25-point thank-you, and the rest come from taking part: Bounties, competitions and community activity. A topic Guide is $11, or 1,100 points.'),
('83a2cf1b-008e-4903-8f66-9c7c0bf61332'::uuid,'No. Points are never bought: they come from the survey, taking part (Bounties, competitions, the community) and a small thank-you on every purchase. If you want a topic Guide now, it is $11.'),
('8cae26bc-ee73-4f11-955a-e49d8de6d213'::uuid,'Voting is for members. Sign in and take the short survey, free, and you can vote every day.'),
('8dc33c97-9be8-4cbf-8b0b-4b83bcc5f55f'::uuid,'Cash commissions are paused for now. Your link still earns 111 points for every friend who becomes a member. Commissions already earned are still paid on their usual terms.'),
('974cb4fa-782d-4a02-9c15-b26a032e69bf'::uuid,'Start by becoming a member, free with a short survey, and claim your page, also free. For the full experience there is the $111 Partner plan: a front-row seat on our campaigns, ads placed for you and a campaign manager.'),
('a29b4ba9-b724-4219-8f3a-590a6f19d2ad'::uuid,'Yes. Membership is free, and once you are in you can contribute from $11 any time from your dashboard, to help us build faster. It brings a 25-point thank-you and is never a tax-deductible donation.'),
('a3833b9b-675c-4da1-95b7-04c097edf849'::uuid,'Nothing. Membership is free: take a short survey, about two minutes, and you are in, with 250 points. If you want to help us build faster, you can contribute from $11 once you are in.'),
('c5a7f527-881a-4be5-9c02-48532a988239'::uuid,'The survey gives you 250 points when you finish it. After that you earn points by taking part: Bounties, check-ins, competitions and what you do in the community.'),
('d8aab6ac-4a23-4fe2-988d-e7ced57d7f00'::uuid,'Some events hosted by our Group Partners sell tickets right on the event''s page, for members. You pay the ticket price plus card processing (about 2.9% plus 30 cents); the group may also pass on our 5% fee, and checkout shows it if so. Your door codes come by email and are on the event''s page.'),
('f3a4c19f-d7ce-4f3b-a329-58c7912ea316'::uuid,'Tap Submit listing at the top of the Directory to add a business, or Claim on its page if it is already listed. Both are free for members, and we review every one by hand.'),
('f8aec98b-c02b-438e-a398-d2c5c80e269a'::uuid,'Founding Membership closes at midnight Eastern on January 1, 2027. Become a member before then, by finishing the survey, and Founding Member stays on your profile for good.'),
('ff0b6127-af1e-473e-8060-071b446480cb'::uuid,'Find your business on the claim page and claim it. It is free for members (membership is a short survey), and we review every claim by hand.')
) v(id, a) where g.id = v.id;
